    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28571" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠνᾰμό-κῠβος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>square multiplied by cube,
				fifth power</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hippol.
				<u>Haer.</u>
				1.2.10
			</span></i>; <i>fifth power of unknown quantity (x</i><i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Dioph.
				<u>Def.</u>
				1
			</span></i> (pl.), al.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠνᾰμο-κῠβοστόν</span></b> , τό,
				<i>the fraction</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i>x</i><i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Def.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, al.</div>
